OL,5,G1550 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe last visit is to The New Inn
OL,7,     Fin Talgarth, where ex-naval
OL,8,     Fofficer Damon Lewis is the captain
OL,9,     Fof his ship. Fay and Ray have high
OL,10,     Fexpectations, but Damon feels the
OL,11,     Fpressure at breakfast.
OL,12,G1620 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FIt's payment day and the B&Bers
OL,14,     Fmeet for the last time. Tensions
OL,15,     Fcome to a head, as the group air
OL,16,     Ftheir grievances and find out how
OL,17,     Fmuch they've been paid, before the
OL,18,     Fwinner is announced.
